## The visuals

The product ships an emerald visual set -- a wallpaper, a GDM mark and a GRUB
image -- under the same `AGPL-3.0-or-later` as the code. The displayed name is
`Workstation Edition`; a fork or a site that wants its own marks declares its
own files through the variables `README.md` documents and keeps its own licence
for them. No proprietary visual ships in this work.

## The Plymouth theme

`assets/branding/theme/workstation/` is the boot splash. Its script derives from
Debian's `softwaves` theme; the emerald images are new work by Younes
BENMOUSSA. The whole theme is distributed under `GPL-2.0-or-later`. Copyright:

- 2009 Canonical Ltd.;
